Subject: [PATCH 9/9] SCH-108: Preserve exact quota policy revisions in status
 JSON

Encode the policy revision as a decimal string alongside exact resource quantities. Extend the pending authenticated read with values above binary64 precision and MaxInt64, and verify the JSON string contract. Keep the internal admission counter unchanged.

Research RFC 8259 and the Kubernetes metadata convention; verify owner source, gofmt and diff hygiene. Go and PostgreSQL gates remain pending resource windows.
